{
	"name": "Silencing Shot",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/ammunition/arrow-broadhead-glowing-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Spellcasting is one of the most dangerous forms of combat one can employ against you, and you are prepared to punish it harshly. As a reaction to a creature casting a spell within your normal weapon range, you may make a ranged attack. If your attack hits, your target takes piercing damage equal to your Dexterity modifier plus Proficiency bonus and must make a concentration check against your combat maneuver DC. On a failed check, the spell is lost and their action is wasted.</p>",
